{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OOPS! Simulator offers a <strong>patience- and attention-focused experience</strong> set on a <strong>linear street map in a Japanese-themed city</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player\u2019s goal is simple: reach the end of the street. However, after every death and every new attempt, the <strong>correct path</strong>, <strong>hazard locations</strong>, and <strong>safe routes are randomized</strong>. Memorization is impossible \u2014 each step must be taken carefully and consciously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is not reflex-based or fast-paced. Instead, it is built around <strong>learning from mistakes</strong>, <strong>staying calm</strong>, and <strong>maintaining focus</strong>, offering a punishing yet fair structure. A single moment of carelessness can reset all progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reaching the end of the street tests not only the game mechanics but also the player\u2019s <strong>patience</strong>, <strong>concentration</strong>, and <strong>mental resilience</strong>. Success comes not from speed, but from falling repeatedly and advancing more carefully each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world that changes as you pay attention (or stop paying attention).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087250/extras/d7b7a03b9ebf6275485387c0f435458a.poster.avif?t=1773078042\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087250/extras/d7b7a03b9ebf6275485387c0f435458a.webm?t=1773078042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087250/extras/d7b7a03b9ebf6275485387c0f435458a.mp4?t=1773078042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls \u2014 complex perception.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087250/extras/6308ad01d86f78b911e7adcb99051f83.poster.avif?t=1773078042\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087250/extras/6308ad01d86f78b911e7adcb99051f83.webm?t=1773078042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087250/extras/6308ad01d86f78b911e7adcb99051f83.mp4?t=1773078042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A surreal atmosphere filled with strange details and unexpected moments.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087250/extras/5927424290cba19f5f6265f5eb592682.poster.avif?t=1773078042\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087250/extras/5927424290cba19f5f6265f5eb592682.webm?t=1773078042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087250/extras/5927424290cba19f5f6265f5eb592682.mp4?t=1773078042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4087250?t=1773078042","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4087250?t=1773078042","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087250/6d2c4719e7deb9b3e835